    {
      "language": "zh-Hant",
      "type": "abstract",
      "text": "《西醫舉隅》（Xi yi ju yu）是德貞（John Dudgeon）從《中西聞見錄》輯出的醫學論集，牛津館目著錄為 1875 年、[北京]，館藏號 Sinica 1842。原書有五篇序文，並以文字和圖解介紹心臟、血液運行、眼學與法醫學等主題，可供晚清醫學史、翻譯史及出版史研究。本版以 JSON、TXT 和 TEI 提供 161 個來源位置的轉錄，涵蓋所列正文、小註、圖中文字及表格。c060 左半、c061–c074 及 c075 右半 的疫苗操作段落未收入。轉錄採 AI 輔助，已標示疑讀與原件位置，尚未經人類全文校勘。"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "abstract",
      "text": "Xi yi ju yu [Gleanings of Western medicine] is John Dudgeon’s collection of medical articles from Zhong xi wen jian lu, catalogued as 1875 [Peking] and held as Bodleian Sinica 1842. Its five prefaces and illustrated essays on the heart, circulation, eyes, and forensic medicine support research on late Qing medical history, translation, and publishing. This release offers JSON, TXT, and TEI transcriptions across 161 source positions with notes, labels, tables, and source links. Historical vaccination instructions at c060 left, c061–c074 and c075 right are outside its coverage. The AI-assisted transcription marks uncertain readings and awaits full human collation."
    }
  ],
